#######################
## Contracts Service ##
#######################

### Contracts  - Get All Contracts
GET http://localhost:4004/FAST/ctr/Contracts
Authorization: Basic YXJ0aW9t

### Contracts  - Get Contract by ID - ODATA V2
GET http://localhost:4004/FAST/ctr/Contracts(guid'8d5475be-e85b-11ea-adc1-0242ac120002')?
    &$expand=Products/Deliveries,Products/Letters,Institute,Channel,Distributor,SellingCompany
Authorization: Basic YXJ0aW9t

### Contracts  - Get Contract by ID - ODATA V4
GET http://localhost:4004/FAST/ctr/Contracts(8d5475be-e85b-11ea-adc1-0242ac120002)?
    &$expand=Products/Deliveries,Products/Letters,Institute,Channel,Distributor,SellingCompany
Authorization: Basic YXJ0aW9t


###Contracts  - Create new Contract
POST http://localhost:4004/FAST/ctr/Contracts
Authorization: Basic YXJ0aW9t
Content-Type: application/json

